=== example/remote_weather.ag ===
-- source --
1 "# Calls a Weather agent that is being served elsewhere."
2 "#"
3 "#   1. In one terminal:   export METAGENTE_TOKEN=$(metagente token)"
4 "#                         metagente serve weather.ag"
5 "#   2. In metagente.toml, next to this file, name the variable that holds the same token:"
6 "#                         [credentials]"
7 "#                         Bob = \"BOB_TOKEN\""
8 "#   3. In another terminal:  export BOB_TOKEN=<the same token>"
9 "#                            metagente trust remote_weather.ag"
10 "#                            metagente run remote_weather.ag plan city=Lisbon"
11 "#"
12 "# The agent is at /agents/NAME of the server, and its card is read with the token."
13 "agent Trip"
14 "  goal \"Ask a remote weather agent\""
15 "  remote Bob at \"http://127.0.0.1:8080/agents/Weather\""
16 "  accepts plan city"
17 "  on plan"
18 "    forecast = Bob.ask city: city"
19 "    reply \"Bob says: {forecast}\""
